{
    "title": "Vivid Picks Fantasy Sports",
    "description": "VIVID PICKS \u2013 DAILY FANTASY SPORTS GAME AND IN-GAME PLAY FOR CASH\r\n\r\nMake real money picks on all your favorite sports and huge payouts with Vivid Picks. Select today\u2019s top fantasy sports players in Football, Baseball, Soccer, Basketball, eSports, Golf, Tennis, Racing, and more to build your Over/Under and Versus entries to win real cash.\r\n\r\n------------------------\r\n\r\nWHY VIVID PICKS DAILY FANTASY SPORTS APP?\r\n\r\nVivid Picks offers all the best players from the hottest fantasy sports leagues like NFL, NBA, NHL, MLB, and more all within a simple interface that is easy to use with some of the industry's highest payouts. Choose players across different leagues and positions with our multi-sport integration and get in on the action while watching the game in person or at home with our real-time updates. We also provide live 2nd half contest options for all our fans that can take your game-day experience to the next level. Vivid Picks is also the only Daily Fantasy Sports app that is fully integrated with Vivid Seats to help you make your pick and get your tickets all in the same app.\r\n\r\n------------------------\r\n\r\nWHAT TYPES OF DAILY FANTASY GAMES DO YOU OFFER?\r\n\r\nWe have 2 main types of games Over/Under and Versus. Over/under games allow you to pick from multiple players' stats and how they will perform in the game using a simple over/under interface while our Versus game allows you to select a stat between 2 players and watch them battle it out on during the game.\r\n\r\n------------------------\r\n\r\nBEST APP FOR FANTASY SPORTS FANS!\r\n\r\nWe have everything for diehard sports fans and everyday causal sports consumers - ranging from the fantasy football enthusiast to the casual onlooker with an industry-leading variety of sports for you to play:\r\n\u30fbFantasy Football\r\n\u30fbFantasy College Football\r\n\u30fbFantasy Basketball\r\n\u30fbFantasy College Basketball\r\n\u30fbFantasy esports\r\n\u30fbFantasy Baseball\r\n\u30fbFantasy Golf\r\n\u30fbFantasy Hockey\r\n\u30fbFantasy Tennis\r\n\u30fbFantasy Soccer\r\n\u30fbFantasy Racing\r\n\u30fbFantasy MMA and UFC\r\n& so many more!\r\n\r\nAt Vivid Picks we offer multiple sports entries on a single entry. That means you can win real cash by combining players you pick from the NFL, NCAAF, CFL, CFB, NBA, WNBA, F1, CBB, PGA, MLB, NHL, NASCAR, EPL, MLS, LOL, COD, CS2, and more!\r\n\r\n------------------------\r\n\r\nDO YOU HAVE ANY PROMOTIONS?\r\n\r\n\u30fbVivid Picks offers a number of promotions to help you maximize your winnings and enhance the fun. These include:\r\n\u30fbSign-up Up Offers (Use promo code \"PLAYSTORE\" for a 100% deposit match up to $100!)\r\n\u30fbDiscounted player projections\r\n\u30fbPartial Payouts\r\n\u30fbRedeposit Bonus\r\n\u30fbProtected Plays\r\n\u30fbFlash Sales\r\n\u30fbReward Challenges\r\n\u30fbSocial Boosts\r\n\u30fbFan Based Leaderboards\r\n\u30fbFan Based Challenges\r\n\u30fbPre-Packaged Boosts\r\n\u30fbFree-to-play games\r\n\u30fbPlayer Power Ups\r\n\r\n------------------------\r\n\r\nWHO CAN PLAY?\r\n\r\nUS residents only. Users must be 18 or older. Users physically located in Alaska, Arkansas, California, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Kentucky, Minnesota, Nebraska (19+), New Mexico, North Carolina, North Dakota, Oklahoma, Oregon, Rhode Island, South Carolina, South Dakota, Texas, Utah, Vermont, and Wisconsin are eligible to participate in paid contests.\r\n\r\n------------------------\r\n\r\nRESPONSIBLE GAMING HELP?\r\n\r\nAt Vivid Picks, we\u2019re committed to protecting our players and helping them play responsibly. We offer proactive tools, resources, and support to encourage healthy behavior. For more info, visit https://www.vividpicks.com/responsible-gaming.",
    "descriptionHTML": "VIVID PICKS \u2013 DAILY FANTASY SPORTS GAME AND IN-GAME PLAY FOR CASH<br><br>Make real money picks on all your favorite sports and huge payouts with Vivid Picks. Select today\u2019s top fantasy sports players in Football, Baseball, Soccer, Basketball, eSports, Golf, Tennis, Racing, and more to build your Over/Under and Versus entries to win real cash.<br><br>------------------------<br><br>WHY VIVID PICKS DAILY FANTASY SPORTS APP?<br><br>Vivid Picks offers all the best players from the hottest fantasy sports leagues like NFL, NBA, NHL, MLB, and more all within a simple interface that is easy to use with some of the industry&#39;s highest payouts. Choose players across different leagues and positions with our multi-sport integration and get in on the action while watching the game in person or at home with our real-time updates. We also provide live 2nd half contest options for all our fans that can take your game-day experience to the next level. Vivid Picks is also the only Daily Fantasy Sports app that is fully integrated with Vivid Seats to help you make your pick and get your tickets all in the same app.<br><br>------------------------<br><br>WHAT TYPES OF DAILY FANTASY GAMES DO YOU OFFER?<br><br>We have 2 main types of games Over/Under and Versus. Over/under games allow you to pick from multiple players&#39; stats and how they will perform in the game using a simple over/under interface while our Versus game allows you to select a stat between 2 players and watch them battle it out on during the game.<br><br>------------------------<br><br>BEST APP FOR FANTASY SPORTS FANS!<br><br>We have everything for diehard sports fans and everyday causal sports consumers - ranging from the fantasy football enthusiast to the casual onlooker with an industry-leading variety of sports for you to play:<br>\u30fbFantasy Football<br>\u30fbFantasy College Football<br>\u30fbFantasy Basketball<br>\u30fbFantasy College Basketball<br>\u30fbFantasy esports<br>\u30fbFantasy Baseball<br>\u30fbFantasy Golf<br>\u30fbFantasy Hockey<br>\u30fbFantasy Tennis<br>\u30fbFantasy Soccer<br>\u30fbFantasy Racing<br>\u30fbFantasy MMA and UFC<br>&amp; so many more!<br><br>At Vivid Picks we offer multiple sports entries on a single entry. That means you can win real cash by combining players you pick from the NFL, NCAAF, CFL, CFB, NBA, WNBA, F1, CBB, PGA, MLB, NHL, NASCAR, EPL, MLS, LOL, COD, CS2, and more!<br><br>------------------------<br><br>DO YOU HAVE ANY PROMOTIONS?<br><br>\u30fbVivid Picks offers a number of promotions to help you maximize your winnings and enhance the fun. These include:<br>\u30fbSign-up Up Offers (Use promo code &quot;PLAYSTORE&quot; for a 100% deposit match up to $100!)<br>\u30fbDiscounted player projections<br>\u30fbPartial Payouts<br>\u30fbRedeposit Bonus<br>\u30fbProtected Plays<br>\u30fbFlash Sales<br>\u30fbReward Challenges<br>\u30fbSocial Boosts<br>\u30fbFan Based Leaderboards<br>\u30fbFan Based Challenges<br>\u30fbPre-Packaged Boosts<br>\u30fbFree-to-play games<br>\u30fbPlayer Power Ups<br><br>------------------------<br><br>WHO CAN PLAY?<br><br>US residents only. Users must be 18 or older. Users physically located in Alaska, Arkansas, California, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Kentucky, Minnesota, Nebraska (19+), New Mexico, North Carolina, North Dakota, Oklahoma, Oregon, Rhode Island, South Carolina, South Dakota, Texas, Utah, Vermont, and Wisconsin are eligible to participate in paid contests.<br><br>------------------------<br><br>RESPONSIBLE GAMING HELP?<br><br>At Vivid Picks, we\u2019re committed to protecting our players and helping them play responsibly. We offer proactive tools, resources, and support to encourage healthy behavior. For more info, visit https://www.vividpicks.com/responsible-gaming.",
